    "profile": {
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "HTML",
          "html": "William Solomon made one Test appearance, against Lord Hawke's side in 1898-99, scoring 2 and 2.  His selection came about as a result of two gutsy innings - 64 for a Johannesburg XV and then 52 for Transvaal.  His first-class career spanned 13  years but totalled five matches - two in 1892-93, two in 1898-99, and a final outing for Eastern Province in 1905-06\n<BR><B>Martin Williamson</B>"
        }
      ]
    },
